%N A400073 Number of compositions (ordered partitions) of n such that (greatest part) - (least part) >= 3.
%F A400073 G.f.: x / (1 - 2*x) - Sum_{j>=1} x^j / ( (1 - x^j - x^(j+1) - x^(j+2)) * (1 - x^(j+1) - x^(j+2)) ).
%e A400073 a(6) = 5 because we have [5,1], [4,1,1], [1,4,1], [1,1,4] and [1,5].
%t A400073 nmax = 36; CoefficientList[Series[x/(1 - 2 x) - Sum[x^j/((1 - x^j - x^(j + 1) - x^(j + 2)) (1 - x^(j + 1) - x^(j + 2))), {j, 1, nmax}], {x, 0, nmax}], x] // Rest
